Description: 4k executable graphics by Suricrasia Online, released in 2020
 Enamel Pin renders a single 1920x1080 picture of an enamel pin lying on
 fabric, entirely from a GLSL path tracing shader driven by a small GTK
 program. The number of samples can be set with the SAMPLES environment
 variable.
 .
 Enamel Pin was awarded first place at Solskogen 2020 in the 4k procedural
 graphics category.
